# --- Provenance: Mojang-derived data must never be committed (SPEC 12) ---
# Anything produced by tools/fetch-vanilla, extracted from a jar, or
# generated by running the vanilla server lives here and stays on the
# machine that made it, or within this repository's CI (its runners and its
# Actions cache).
# No trailing slash: in a worktree .fixtures is a SYMLINK to the main
# checkout's copy, and a directory-only pattern does not match a symlink —
# which left Mojang-derived data one `git add -A` away from being committed.
/.fixtures
/fixtures
*.jar
*.mca
*.mcr
*.dat
*.nbt
# Vanilla worldgen JSON extracted from a jar / data generator.
**/vanilla_worldgen/
**/generated/data/minecraft/worldgen/
# A frozen pipeline is that JSON compiled (SPEC 6), wherever it lands —
# stratum-pipeline.blob in a world's folder, and the .partial-* file
# freezePipeline writes before renaming it over one.
*.blob
*.blob.partial-*
# What tools/pmmp-dev writes into a PocketMine-MP server directory, and the
# server adds: refused inside this checkout outside build/, and each such
# directory ignores itself; these are a further guard. worlds/ holds LevelDB
# chunks generated from a frozen pipeline; the phars are plugin builds
# (build_plugin_phar.php), never published from here.
worlds/
*.phar
.stratum-pmmp-server
generator-options.json
stratum-evidence.json
stratum-evidence-report.json
server.properties
pocketmine.yml
php.ini
server.log
console.in
console.out

# The Researcher process and its repository are not a permitted reference
# (CLAUDE.md's provenance rule) -- only its filtered output under spec/ is.
# PROVENANCE.md and RESEARCHER-BRIEF.md are its own notes and provenance
# tracking, and must never land here; they already did once, by accident, in
# 761b8a1. AUDIT.md is deliberately not listed here -- the owner asked to
# leave it as committed rather than have this rule reach it too.
/PROVENANCE.md
/RESEARCHER-BRIEF.md
/RESEARCH-RUN-*.md

# --- Build ---
/build/
/out/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeUserPresets.json
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
compile_commands.json
_deps/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.lib
*.pdb
*.exe

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Tooling / editors ---
.cache/
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
